<title>UK: Merrill Lynch sets 30 billion yen Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets 30 billion yen Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Merrill Lynch International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MERRILL LYNCH AND CO INC</p>
<p> AMT     30 BLN YEN   COUPON     2.00	MATURITY    21.AUG.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.25    PAY DATE    21.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.25	LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (M) 100	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
